                href={s.url}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                className="text-cyan-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
              >
                {s.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

